{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1041610-so-long-for-now-onyx-path-and-thanks-for-the-memories","id":1041610,"title":"So Long For Now, Onyx Path (And Thanks For the Memories)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-31T18:23:22-08:00","id":1041610,"title":"So Long For Now, Onyx Path (And Thanks For the Memories)","content":"I've been thinking on this for a while, and I'm thinking of temporarily calling it quits on Onyx Path forums for a while. There's no real reason in particular other than the fact that I don't post here often anymore and I'm kind of drifting away from White Wolf/Onyx Path products in general and gravitating back to my roots in RPG's, namely Big Eyes Small Mouth and Dungeons &amp; Dragons. So, I'm going to take an extended break from these forums for a while.<br /> <br /> \u200bNow, I'm probably going to come back eventually (don't know exactly when), so it's not a farewell so much as it's a &quot;See You Later&quot; scenario, but I figured I'd give a shout out to all the folks on Onyx Path Forums whom I have fond memories of.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'd like to give thanks to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1090-tobias\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1090_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1090\" data-vbnamecard=\"1090\">Tobias</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a>, and countless others on here who made my experience on Onyx Path a good one. Not sure if I'm going to delete this account and make a new one if or when I eventually return, or just keep this one. But I'll probably be back eventually. I just need a break from WoD and CofD, and focus on more important things in my life, as well as get back to my gaming roots in my spare time.<br /> <br /> \u200bI've had plenty of ups and downs on this forum as well as its predecessor, but overall, I've had a good run for now and I'm thinking I'll take an extended break. Rest assured that I will probably be back later. But for now, I need a break. However, I made this thread to show my appreciation for this forum and its users since I'll be taking a minimum of a few months off, maybe longer.<br /> <br /> Best of wishes and I'll see you around sometime. Don't worry, it's only for a while. I'll probably come back in the spring or summer, I don't know. Depends on how I'm feeling at that time and how things are looking for me in real life.<br /> <br /> \u200bYou folks are awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1579,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","user":"Camilla","date":". 01-31-2017, 09:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thank